Package: pollinatorSDM
Title: Species Distribution Models for Pollinators and Pollination Deficit
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Idriss", "Lemnouni", email = "idriss@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Models pollinator distribution, analyzes suitable habitats,
    estimates pollination services, and detects pollination deficit zones
    using species distribution models and landscape analysis.
